# CRC Cards

CRC stands for:

- **C** — Class
- **R** — Responsibilities
- **C** — Collaborators

---

## CRC Card 1 — Customer

| Class | Responsibilities | Collaborators |
|---|---|---|
| **Customer** | Log into the system; view available services; select a service; select a preferred date and time; confirm a booking; cancel the booking process before confirmation; view booking details; view updated booking status. | Service, TimeSlot, Booking, ServiceProvider |

---

## CRC Card 2 — ServiceProvider

| Class | Responsibilities | Collaborators |
|---|---|---|
| **ServiceProvider** | Log into the system; view available booking requests; view booking details; accept a booking; reject a booking; perform the requested service; update booking status. | Booking, Customer, Service, TimeSlot |

---

## CRC Card 3 — Admin

| Class | Responsibilities | Collaborators |
|---|---|---|
| **Admin** | Monitor bookings; manage booking information; ensure bookings are properly recorded; monitor booking status. | Booking, Customer, ServiceProvider, Service |

---

## CRC Card 4 — Service

| Class | Responsibilities | Collaborators |
|---|---|---|
| **Service** | Store service information; provide service details; represent the service requested by a customer; provide service information to customers. | Customer, Booking, ServiceProvider |

---

## CRC Card 5 — Booking

| Class | Responsibilities | Collaborators |
|---|---|---|
| **Booking** | Create a booking; store booking information; maintain booking status; associate a customer with a service; associate a service provider with a booking; store the selected time slot; provide booking details; confirm a booking; reject a booking; complete a booking; update booking status. | Customer, Service, ServiceProvider, TimeSlot, Admin |

---

## CRC Card 6 — TimeSlot

| Class | Responsibilities | Collaborators |
|---|---|---|
| **TimeSlot** | Store the date of a service; store the time of a service; represent an available time slot; check whether a time slot is available; reserve a selected time slot. | Customer, Booking, ServiceProvider |

---

## CRC Summary

| Class | Main Responsibilities |
|---|---|
| Customer | View services, select service, book service, view booking |
| ServiceProvider | Accept/reject bookings, perform service, update status |
| Admin | Monitor and manage bookings |
| Service | Store and provide service information |
| Booking | Create and manage booking information and status |
| TimeSlot | Store and manage date/time availability |
